  "details": "With the Friends tab on the quick menu Wing now defaulting to sort by location, the world photos take up about 2/3 of the space on the list. The list used to be more compact without these photos, allowing you to see more friends at once.\n\nYou can change it to sort by Status to see more friends at a time, but the setting is reset when you restart the game. It would be nice to simply have the game remember which sorting options you selected.",
